# Go Security

> This file extends the common security rule with Go specific content.

## Secret Management

```go
apiKey := os.Getenv("OPENAI_API_KEY")
if apiKey == "" {
    log.Fatal("OPENAI_API_KEY not configured")
}
```

## Security Scanning (END-ONLY — run only at the very end of the project or when the user explicitly asks; deferred security audit, see hackathon-mode §3)

- Use **gosec** for static security analysis (END-ONLY):
  ```bash
  gosec ./...
  ```

## Context & Timeouts

Always use `context.Context` for timeout control:

```go
ctx, cancel := context.WithTimeout(ctx, 5*time.Second)
defer cancel()
```
